{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535640/extras/394c6e13b17eb91761de7853eee22cc5.avif?t=1770207122\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535640/extras_big/394c6e13b17eb91761de7853eee22cc5.avif?t=1770207122 width=800 height=212 /></span>Interact with bizarre mechanisms, think out of the box to gain your freedom, and discover historical mysteries </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535640/extras/f6c33ce4608c5d6263ceaf674e953b27.poster.avif?t=1770207122\" width=614 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535640/extras/f6c33ce4608c5d6263ceaf674e953b27.webm?t=1770207122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535640/extras/f6c33ce4608c5d6263ceaf674e953b27.mp4?t=1770207122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535640/extras/ec0d4127ced236394157ce331918799d.avif?t=1770207122\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535640/extras_big/ec0d4127ced236394157ce331918799d.avif?t=1770207122 width=800 height=212 /></span>You will experience a real-life adventure while playing this puzzle game! Lots of intriguing puzzles are waiting for you, ensuring an immersive experience that will keep you engaged for hours </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535640/extras/7e97b2b4b8e5706b2f0220fa7b0ea94d.avif?t=1770207122\" width=614 height=178 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535640/extras/65f8444bd7166f1ba752b34d32d677d9.avif?t=1770207122\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535640/extras_big/65f8444bd7166f1ba752b34d32d677d9.avif?t=1770207122 width=800 height=212 /></span>Examine several mechanisms to unlock each box and gain your freedom </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535640/extras/c5a0da0da35b19bd6b411d8659446354.poster.avif?t=1770207122\" width=614 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535640/extras/c5a0da0da35b19bd6b411d8659446354.webm?t=1770207122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535640/extras/c5a0da0da35b19bd6b411d8659446354.mp4?t=1770207122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535640/extras/5b890bfd70dce3cef1596e57d367e61b.avif?t=1770207122\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535640/extras_big/5b890bfd70dce3cef1596e57d367e61b.avif?t=1770207122 width=800 height=212 /></span>For an unforgettable experience, immerse yourself in the adventure by playing the game with your headphones on! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535640/extras/ed0cd39d97d142c60e6fec64f76172e8.avif?t=1770207122\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535640/extras_big/ed0cd39d97d142c60e6fec64f76172e8.avif?t=1770207122 width=800 height=212 /></span>Click the bulb button to get hints that will help you through the game, or get in touch with the developer if you seriously get stuck ;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535640/extras/f190ac9fb8841e5215327e0001f69f6d.avif?t=1770207122\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535640/extras_big/f190ac9fb8841e5215327e0001f69f6d.avif?t=1770207122 width=800 height=212 /></span>This is an extra challenge that will keep your brain busy for days. Open the letter inside the Enigmas Box and crack a new riddle daily. How far can you go? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535640/extras/a1ef435bf16d1f717e765ef3b9afb87e.poster.avif?t=1770207122\" width=614 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535640/extras/a1ef435bf16d1f717e765ef3b9afb87e.webm?t=1770207122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535640/extras/a1ef435bf16d1f717e765ef3b9afb87e.mp4?t=1770207122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535640/extras/4157dbc5c37eb63c9439ef067be3eed1.avif?t=1770207122\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535640/extras_big/4157dbc5c37eb63c9439ef067be3eed1.avif?t=1770207122 width=800 height=212 /></span>Available in English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Russian, and Japanese.*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*<strong>The game language will change automatically based on the language settings of your device</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535640/extras/f221e128dbdeaebe6f4bbf6c8f11e2ae.avif?t=1770207122\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535640/extras_big/f221e128dbdeaebe6f4bbf6c8f11e2ae.avif?t=1770207122 width=800 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi there, <strong>Frank\u00a0Eno</strong>\u00a0here. I have been creating escape room and puzzle games since 2020 under the name of\u00a0<strong>XSGames</strong>, doing everything\u00a0myself: code, graphics, music, design, concept, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong><i>If you like my works, consider leaving a review here on Steam; your support will be greatly appreciated!</i></strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Engima","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2535640/52c678f4c6038320308537803bb1b70100b49c2c.jpg"},{"name":"The 5 Enigmas","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2535640/f55f7f0d4955982a6e6ec42f76d006b8898e75ac.jpg"},{"name":"The 10 Enigmas","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2535640/68aa5d372c99ae3711d0056c5b7360eeacf9a3bf.jpg"},{"name":"Paradox of Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2535640/e8af401079a0e6e72bdca81ed5fbf612dbff9b42.jpg"},{"name":"Gateway to redemption","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2535640/c14a9503c543fc2509d653ed6b4c498b2b4ecabf.jpg"},{"name":"Sea Wolf","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2535640/8afe0a51c49164ef37641fc66a2063